  <ISORIM_StrikeVehicleDepotMission.questNameRules.rulesStrings>
    <li>questName-&gt;装甲补给站</li>
  </ISORIM_StrikeVehicleDepotMission.questNameRules.rulesStrings>
  <ISORIM_StrikeVehicleDepotMission.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>
    <li>questDescription-&gt;附近的敌对派系正用一座中继站调度载具补给。前往该地摧毁中继站，即可获得燃料与白银。小心埋伏在附近、会追击接近单位的载具。</li>
  </ISORIM_StrikeVehicleDepotMission.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>
